OL,3,GNEWSARare disease drug Tavneos recalled
OL,4,Ain Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drug used to treat rare autoimmune
OL,7,Fdiseases has been recalled from shelves
OL,8,Fin the Republic of Ireland.
OL,10,FTavneos (Avacopan) is made by the US
OL,11,Fbiotech firm Amgen and is sold by
OL,12,Fvarious partner pharmaceutical
OL,13,Fcompanies around the world.
OL,15,FIn May, Kissei, which owns the rights
OL,16,Fto the drug in Japan, reported 20
OL,17,Fdeaths from more than 8,500 patients
OL,18,Fwho had been treated with it in the
OL,19,Fcountry since 2022.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
