OL,3,GNEWSARare disease drug Tavneos recalled
OL,4,Ain Republic of Ireland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is not clear if Tavneos was the
OL,7,Fdirect cause of the deaths and Amgen
OL,8,Fhas previously said, external "these
OL,9,Ffigures include cases for which a
OL,10,Fcausal relationship with the product
OL,11,Fcould not be determined".
